#!RuleTest
#test TEST-OV-EXCL expect=violation domain=AE
#note "Fix #354 / plan A hazard 1: the rule EXCLUDES AEDECOD (Output_Variables: [!AEDECOD]) yet the AEDECOD=RASH pin still PASSES via the primary-table fallback"
# A green pin is therefore not evidence the exclusion took; the Java driver
# (ExcludedOutputVariablePinFallbackTest) asserts the absence on the projection explicitly.
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=3 AETERM=Rash AEDECOD=RASH AESEV=SEVERE
dataset AE
col USUBJID type=Char
col AESEQ   type=Num
col AETERM  type=Char
col AEDECOD type=Char
col AESEV   type=Char
---
001 | 1 | Headache | HEADACHE | MILD
001 | 2 | Cough    | COUGH    | MODERATE
002 | 1 | Rash     | RASH     | SEVERE
